  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Linhares Urban Development and Land Use Planning Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Urbano y Ordenamiento Territorial de Linhares</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es promover el desarrollo urbano y ordenamiento territorial sostenible de Linares. Los objetivos especficos para esta operacin sern: (i) incrementar el acceso a infraestructura y equipamientos urbanos en la Zona este del Distrito Sede, con enfoque en Cambio Climtico; y (ii) fortalecer la gestin urbana y territorial sostenible, as como la gestin de riesgos socioambientales del municipio.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to promote sustainable urban development and land use planning in Linares. The specific objectives for this operation will be: (i) to increase access to infrastructure and urban facilities in the Eastern Zone of the Headquarters District, with a focus on Climate Change; and (ii) to strengthen sustainable urban and territorial management, as well as the management of socio-environmental risks in the municipality.</narrative>
  </description>
